# Project

- The repository is the source of truth. Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/CURRENT_STATE.md` before editing.
- Implement the next incomplete task from `docs/MASTER_PLAN.md`. Do not build later phases in the same change.
- Do not modify unrelated code.
- When code and docs disagree, trust the code and tests, then correct the docs.
- Update `docs/CURRENT_STATE.md` and `docs/LEARNING_GUIDE.md` in the same change as the behavior.
- Do not mark planned behavior as implemented.
